<title>USA: Chemi-trol, Peterson end unit sale talks.</title>
<headline>Chemi-trol, Peterson end unit sale talks.</headline>
<dateline>GIBSONBURG, Ohio 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemi-Trol Chemical Co said Friday that it and Ronald A. Peterson Inc have ceased negotiations towards a definitive agreement for the acquisition of Chemi-Trol's Cal-Van Tools unit.</p>
<p>Chemi-Trol had announced in April that it had signed a non-binding letter of intent to sell the unit to Ronald A. Peterson for an undisclosed sum.</p>
